div(class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-6    ")
    section(class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-3   ")
        div
            div(class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-[#2E7D32]")
                span(class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#DFF3E2] px-2.5 py-1")
                    span(class="size-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-[#2E7D32]")
                    | 오늘 장터 운영 중
                span(class="text-[#8B7E73]") {{todayLabel}}
            h1(class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#2F241D] ") 오늘 시장, 대신 봐드릴게요.
            p(class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#7B6D62] ") 직접 오기 어려운 날, 마켓버틀러(홍천상인회)가 아침부터 확인한 상품을 대신 전합니다.
        a(routerLink="/posts", class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 self-start rounded-xl border border-[#E4D7CB] bg-white px-4 text-sm font-bold text-[#594A3F] transition hover:border-[#F1B46F] hover:bg-[#FFF5E8]")
            | 오늘 상품 전체보기
            span(aria-hidden="true") →

    section(class="grid gap-5 ")
        article(class="home-hero relative min-h-[390px] overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border border-[#ECD7C1] px-6 py-7 shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgba(95,60,29,0.10)]  ")
            div(class="relative z-10 flex h-full max-w-xl flex-col")
                div(class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#F4C58E] bg-white/75 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-extrabold text-[#A64C1C] backdrop-blur")
                    span(class="text-base") ✦
                    | 오늘의 버틀러 픽
                h2(class="mt-5 text-3xl font-black leading-[1.18] tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#34261D] ")
                    | 시장 한 바퀴,
                    br
                    | 좋은 것만
                    span(class="text-[#E96B2C]") 쏙.
                p(class="mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-[#6C594B]  ")
                    | 홍천 부모님께 보내는 한 끼부터 여행 뒤 생각나는 시장의 맛까지. 마켓버틀러(홍천상인회)가 수량과 상태를 직접 확인합니다.
                div(class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5")
                    a(routerLink="/posts", class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#E96B2C] px-5 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-900/10 transition hover:bg-[#D85A20]")
                        | 장보기 시작
                        span →
                    a(routerLink="/orders", class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#DDCABB] bg-white/80 px-5 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#59483B] backdrop-blur transition hover:bg-white") 주문 확인
                div(class="mt-auto grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 pt-8 ")
                    div(*ngFor="let promise of promises", class="rounded-xl border border-white/70 bg-white/60 px-3 py-2.5 backdrop-blur")
                        p(class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-[#3E6C3D]") {{promise.title}}
                        p(class="mt-0.5 text-[10px] text-[#7C6B5D]") {{promise.text}}

            div(class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-7 -right-5 text-[150px] leading-none drop-shadow-[0_16px_12px_rgba(94,54,24,0.12)]  ") 🧺
            div(class="pointer-events-none absolute right-9 top-8 rotate-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#2E7D32] px-3 py-2 text-xs font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg ") 홍천중앙시장

        article(class="relative min-h-[390px] overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] bg-[#252019] p-4 text-white shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgba(47,36,29,0.18)]")
            div(class="hot-video relative flex h-full min-h-[358px] flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] p-5")
                div(class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between")
                    span(class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#E74A2D] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black tracking-wide")
                        span(class="size-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-white")
                        | SAMPLE 15s
                    button(type="button", (click)="toggleSound()", class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black/25 backdrop-blur", [attr.aria-label]="soundOn ? '소리 끄기' : '소리 켜기'")
                        svg(*ngIf="soundOn", viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="currentColor", stroke-width="1.8", class="size-4")
                            path(d="M5 9v6h4l5 4V5L9 9H5Zm12 1a3 3 0 0 1 0 4m2-7a7 7 0 0 1 0 10", stroke-linecap="round")
                        svg(*ngIf="!soundOn", viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="currentColor", stroke-width="1.8", class="size-4")
                            path(d="M5 9v6h4l5 4V5L9 9H5Zm12 1 4 4m0-4-4 4", stroke-linecap="round")

                button(type="button", (click)="toggleVideo()", class="relative z-10 my-auto flex flex-col items-center self-center text-white", [attr.aria-label]="isPlaying ? '영상 멈춤' : '영상 재생'")
                    span(class="flex size-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/60 bg-black/25 shadow-xl backdrop-blur transition hover:scale-105")
                        svg(*ngIf="!isPlaying", viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="currentColor", class="ml-1 size-7")
                            path(d="m8 5 11 7-11 7V5Z")
                        svg(*ngIf="isPlaying", viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="currentColor", class="size-7")
                            path(d="M7 5h4v14H7zm6 0h4v14h-4z")
                    span(class="mt-2 text-[11px] font-bold") {{isPlaying ? '샘플 재생 중' : '현장 영상 샘플 보기'}}

                div(class="relative z-10")
                    div(class="mb-3 h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/25")
                        div(class="h-full rounded-full bg-white transition-all duration-500", [style.width]="isPlaying ? '68%' : '18%'")
                    p(class="text-lg font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em]") 방금 부쳐 더 고소한 홍총떡
                    p(class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-white/75") 새벽부터 반죽한 메밀과 아삭한 무채. 김명자 상인의 손맛을 버틀러가 전해요.
                    a(routerLink="/posts/hongchongtteok/detail", class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-extrabold text-[#FFD39F]") 상품 바로보기 →

    section(class="mt-10")
        div(class="flex items-end justify-between")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#E96B2C]") Quick market
                h2(class="mt-1 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#2F241D] ") 오늘 뭐가 필요하세요?
            p(class="hidden text-xs text-[#8B7E73] ") 오늘 판매 가능한 상품만 보여드려요.
        div(class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-4 gap-2  ")
            button(*ngFor="let category of categories", type="button", (click)="goCategory(category.name)", class="group flex min-h-24 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-[#E7DCD2] bg-[#FFFDF8] px-2 py-3 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#F1B46F] hover:shadow-md")
                span(class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F5EDE5] text-2xl transition group-hover:bg-[#FFF0DD]") {{category.icon}}
                span(class="text-xs font-bold text-[#5F5146]") {{category.name}}

    section(class="mt-12")
        div(class="flex items-end justify-between")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#2E7D32]") Butler checked
                h2(class="mt-1 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#2F241D] ") 버틀러가 확인한 오늘의 추천
            a(routerLink="/posts", class="text-xs font-extrabold text-[#A95625]") 더 보기 →
        div(class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3  ")
            article(*ngFor="let product of products", class="group overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] border border-[#E7DCD2] bg-[#FFFDF8] transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_18px_45px_rgba(71,50,34,0.10)]")
                a(routerLink="/posts/{{product.id}}/detail", class="block")
                    div(class="relative flex aspect-[4/3] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden", [ngClass]="product.bg")
                        span(class="transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-110", [ngClass]="product.emojiSize || 'text-7xl'") {{product.emoji}}
                        div(class="absolute left-3 top-3 flex gap-1.5")
                            span(class="rounded-full bg-white/90 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold text-[#2E7D32] shadow-sm") 버틀러 확인
                            span(*ngIf="product.signature", class="rounded-full bg-[#2F241D] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold text-white") 시그니처
                        span(class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 rounded-full bg-black/55 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-white backdrop-blur") {{product.cutoff}} 마감
                div(class="p-4")
                    div(class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3")
                        div(class="min-w-0")
                            p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#8B7E73]") {{product.shop}}
                            a(routerLink="/posts/{{product.id}}/detail", class="mt-1 block truncate text-[15px] font-extrabold text-[#2F241D]") {{product.name}}
                            p(class="mt-2 text-base font-black text-[#2F241D]") {{product.price | number}}원
                                span(class="ml-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#8B7E73]") / {{product.unit}}
                        button(type="button", (click)="addToCart(product, $event)", class="flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#FFF0DD] text-[#C65B1E] transition hover:bg-[#E96B2C] hover:text-white", aria-label="장바구니 담기")
                            svg(viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="currentColor", stroke-width="1.9", class="size-5")
                                path(d="M12 5v14M5 12h14", stroke-linecap="round")

    section(class="signature-banner relative mt-12 overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-[#C7E7CC] px-6 py-7  ")
        div(class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl")
            p(class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#2E7D32]") Hongcheon signature box
            h2(class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#2F241D] ") 홍천의 맛을 한 상자에 담았어요.
            p(class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[#6E6258]") 홍총떡, 올챙이국수 밀키트, 제철 산나물까지. 멀리 있는 가족에게 홍천의 안부를 보내보세요.
            a(routerLink="/posts/signature-box/detail", class="mt-5 inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-xl bg-[#2E7D32] px-4 text-sm font-extrabold text-white transition hover:bg-[#256A29]") 시그니처 박스 보기
        div(class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-7 right-4 text-[120px]  ") 🎁

    section(class="mt-12 grid gap-3 pb-4 ")
        div(*ngFor="let feature of features", class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-[#E7DCD2] bg-white p-4")
            span(class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#F5EDE5] text-xl") {{feature.icon}}
            div
                p(class="text-sm font-extrabold text-[#3F332A]") {{feature.title}}
                p(class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-[#83756A]") {{feature.text}}

    section(class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 pb-4")
        a(routerLink="/guide/benefits", class="rounded-[22px] border border-[#E7DCD2] bg-[#FFFDF8] p-4")
            span(class="text-2xl") 🎁
            p(class="mt-3 text-sm font-extrabold") 회원혜택 · 적립금
            p(class="mt-1 text-[10px] leading-4 text-[#83756A]") 쿠폰과 포인트 이용 방법을 확인하세요.
        a(routerLink="/guide/delivery", class="rounded-[22px] border border-[#C7E7CC] bg-[#EDF6EB] p-4")
            span(class="text-2xl") 🛵
            p(class="mt-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#315A32]") 배달몰 안내
            p(class="mt-1 text-[10px] leading-4 text-[#647861]") 외부 배달앱 연계 계획과 설치 방법을 안내합니다.
